## Caveats to state in the report

- Distances between clusters and cluster sizes in t-SNE are not meaningful. Only local neighbourhoods are.
- Our Appearance and Off-manifold views follow DiCoME's construction, so those panels are expected to resemble DiCoME's. The Video panel carries the comparison.
- CDFv2 and CDFv3 share real videos, so their real points overlap.

